    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is a spacious luxurious model of a traditional sauna that seats 4 people. The air is heated using electric heaters specifically designed for saunas by Harvia.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This sauna is one the largest we have and it is very accommodating. The natural interior made of Canadian Red cedar is pleasant to the touch. It even smells good when heated. Being inside the sauna feels relaxing by default but if you add all the health benefits that you get from using the sauna it is truly an amazing invention.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">MoonLight sauna units are created to contain up to four people in a kind of a bubble, with less interaction with the outside world. Fewer glass windows help to maintain the feeling of security, as you enjoy a sauna session in peace.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The wholesome experience of using a large sauna in a group or on your own whether you are relaxing or exercising will make your day.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As one of the largest traditional saunas, you will find it a great spot to have a laugh or to relax with friends and family.</span></p>\r\n<br />Traditional Heating Technology requires: Hardwire. Hardwire is recommended, if you opt to a plug, we will send you the following plug for the BC45-E heater:",
